{% if tools_routed %}
# Tools and skills for this turn

A separate routing model reads each user message before you do and chooses the
tools and skill instructions you get for that turn, so they can change between
turns. The skill instructions you need are included below; there is nothing to
load. If the request needs a capability you have no tool for this turn, tell the
user what you can't do rather than approximating it with the tools you have.
{% endif %}
{% if skill_catalog %}
# Available skills

These skills hold detailed, task-specific instructions. Before doing the related
work, load the skill(s) you need with the `load_skill` tool (you may load several
at once). Load only what's relevant.
{% for s in skill_catalog %}
- **{{ s.id }}** — {{ s.description }}
{% endfor %}
{% endif %}
{% for body in skill_always_on %}
{{ body|safe }}
{% endfor %}
